OL,3,AHackers steal data from millions of
OL,4,Aairport customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood that the majority of
OL,7,Fthe data accessed was restricted to
OL,8,Fcustomer email addresses and related to
OL,9,FWiFi sign-ups within the airports'
OL,10,Fterminals.
